{"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":0,"metadata":{"colab":{"provenance":[],"mount_file_id":"1kDIaAfEVkOq8WcsEt_p_hTz_8O56g2E1","authorship_tag":"ABX9TyONyVQZNi4JXu0Kuq6iLSMC"},"kernelspec":{"name":"python3","display_name":"Python 3"},"language_info":{"name":"python"}},"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["**UJI PERILAKU (BEHAVIOR TEST) — Model SD Pariwisata DIY**\n","\n","Dua jenis uji:\n","1. Uji perilaku parsial  — subsistem diuji dengan data aktual sebagai masukan\n","2. Uji perilaku penuh    — seluruh model dijalankan untuk periode pascapatahan\n","\n","Statistik mengikuti Barlas (1989):\n","- E1 = |rata2 simulasi - rata2 data| / |rata2 data|\n","- E2 = |simpangan baku simulasi - simpangan baku data| / simpangan baku data\n","- U1, U2, U3 = proporsi ketidaksamaan (bias, variasi, kovariasi)\n","- DC (U) = simpangan baku galat / (simpangan baku data + simpangan baku simulasi)\n","- Tren  = kemiringan regresi linear data vs simulasi, diuji t (langkah 1 Barlas)\n","- Kategori DC: < 0,4 Baik; 0,4–0,7 Cukup; > 0,7 Kurang (Barlas, 1989)"],"metadata":{"id":"MNEvUWfH5tDK"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["1. Instalasi, upload berkas, dan pengaturan"],"metadata":{"id":"v0DTl_-F5nm9"}},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":11,"metadata":{"id":"_FLn7j_Y5WyJ","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1789990384776,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":5687,"user":{"displayName":"Kevin Atha Fathoni Ramadha","userId":"09413341038730317114"}}},"outputs":[],"source":["!pip install pysd openpyxl matplotlib -q"]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["import warnings\n","from pathlib import Path\n","import numpy as np\n","import pandas as pd\n","import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","import pysd\n","from google.colab import drive\n","\n","warnings.filterwarnings(\"ignore\")\n","\n","FILE_MODEL = \"/content/drive/MyDrive/Skripsi_Citra/Pengujian Model Sistem Dinamis/[02] Uji Perilaku/MODEL SISTEM DINAMIS.mdl\"\n","FILE_DATA = \"/content/drive/MyDrive/Skripsi_Citra/Pengujian Model Sistem Dinamis/[02] Uji Perilaku/[FIX] Master Data.xlsx\"\n","SHEET_DATA = \"Data Tahunan\"\n","FOLDER_OUT = Path(\"hasil_uji_perilaku\")\n","FOLDER_OUT.mkdir(exist_ok=True)\n","\n","TAHUN_AWAL_PARSIAL = 2016      # Lahan Terbangun DW baru tersedia sejak 2016\n","TAHUN_AWAL_PENUH = 2019        # tahun pertama setelah patahan metode data wisatawan\n","TAHUN_AKHIR = 2025\n","TAHUN_COVID = [2020, 2021]\n","\n","# The file upload logic is no longer needed as paths are directly specified\n","# for f in (FILE_MODEL, FILE_DATA):\n","#     if not Path(f).exists():\n","#         from google.colab import files\n","#         print(f\"'{f}' belum ada, silakan upload:\")\n","#         files.upload()\n","\n","# Nama baris di sheet Data Tahunan -> nama variabel di model\n","PETA = {\n","    \"Jumlah Wisatawan\": \"Jumlah Wisatawan\",\n","    \"Jumlah Hotel dan Akomodasi Lainnya\": \"Jumlah Hotel dan Akomodasi\",\n","    \"Jumlah Objek Daya Tarik Wisata\": \"Jumlah Objek Daya Tarik Wisata\",\n","    \"Tenaga Kerja (Based on KBLI I & R,S,T,U)\": \"Tenaga Kerja Pariwisata\",\n","    \"Lahan Terbangun (DynamicWorld)\": \"Lahan Terbangun\",\n","    \"Tingkat Penghunian Kamar (TPK)\": '\"Tingkat Penghunian Kamar (TPK)\"',\n","    \"PDRB ADHK Pariwisata (I & R,S,T,U)\": \"PDRB Sektor Pariwisata\",\n","    \"Investasi Sektor Pariwisata\": \"Investasi Sektor Pariwisata\",\n","    \"Total Malam Menginap\": \"Total Malam Menginap\",\n","}\n","PERSEN = [\"Tingkat Penghunian Kamar (TPK)\"]      # data dalam persen -> dibagi 100\n","\n","import openpyxl\n","ws = openpyxl.load_workbook(FILE_DATA, data_only=True)[SHEET_DATA]\n","kolom = {}\n","for c in range(1, ws.max_column + 1):\n","    v = str(ws.cell(1, c).value).strip()\n","    if v.replace(\".0\", \"\").isdigit():\n","        kolom[int(float(v))] = c\n","\n","def ambil(nama):\n","    for r in range(1, ws.max_row + 1):\n","        if str(ws.cell(r, 2).value).strip() == nama:\n","            s = pd.Series({t: ws.cell(r, c).value for t, c in sorted(kolom.items())}, dtype=\"float64\")\n","            return s / 100 if nama in PERSEN else s\n","    raise ValueError(f\"Baris '{nama}' tidak ditemukan di {SHEET_DATA}\")\n","\n","DATA = {model: ambil(excel) for excel, model in PETA.items()}\n","print(\"Data terbaca:\", \", \".join(k.strip('\"') for k in DATA))"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"hc2hMXbz6EwG","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1789990427660,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":1484,"user":{"displayName":"Kevin Atha Fathoni Ramadha","userId":"09413341038730317114"}},"outputId":"dd23e66f-df9c-4082-b876-10629c8493f2"},"execution_count":13,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Data terbaca: Jumlah Wisatawan, Jumlah Hotel dan Akomodasi, Jumlah Objek Daya Tarik Wisata, Tenaga Kerja Pariwisata, Lahan Terbangun, Tingkat Penghunian Kamar (TPK), PDRB Sektor Pariwisata, Investasi Sektor Pariwisata, Total Malam Menginap\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["2. Penyambungan seri wisatawan (splicing) akibat patahan metode 2018/2019"],"metadata":{"id":"CSg_4WqD6aJe"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["jw = DATA[\"Jumlah Wisatawan\"]\n","\n","g_pra = (jw[2018] / jw[2015]) ** (1 / 3) - 1          # pertumbuhan sebelum patahan\n","g_pasca = (jw[2025] / jw[2021]) ** (1 / 4) - 1        # pertumbuhan setelah pandemi\n","g_wajar = (g_pra + g_pasca) / 2                        # pertumbuhan \"wajar\" pembanding\n","lompatan = jw[2019] / jw[2018] - 1\n","faktor = (1 + lompatan) / (1 + g_wajar)                # bagian lompatan yang bukan perilaku\n","\n","jw_sambung = jw.copy()\n","for t in range(2015, 2019):\n","    jw_sambung[t] = jw[t] * faktor\n","\n","print(f\"Pertumbuhan sebelum patahan   : {g_pra:.2%} per tahun\")\n","print(f\"Pertumbuhan setelah pandemi   : {g_pasca:.2%} per tahun\")\n","print(f\"Lompatan 2018->2019           : {lompatan:.2%}\")\n","print(f\"Faktor penyambungan           : {faktor:.4f}\")\n","print(f\"Wisatawan 2015: {jw[2015]:,.0f} -> setelah disambung {jw_sambung[2015]:,.0f}\")\n","print(f\"Pertumbuhan seri sambungan 2015-2025: {(jw_sambung[2025]/jw_sambung[2015])**0.1-1:.2%} per tahun\")\n","\n","DATA_UJI = dict(DATA)\n","DATA_UJI[\"Jumlah Wisatawan\"] = jw_sambung"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"iCNmdTWw6ktD","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1789990430897,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":8,"user":{"displayName":"Kevin Atha Fathoni Ramadha","userId":"09413341038730317114"}},"outputId":"2a3ecb1f-455b-44ad-fd2a-eaaf3d9ba790"},"execution_count":14,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Pertumbuhan sebelum patahan   : 7.63% per tahun\n","Pertumbuhan setelah pandemi   : 15.52% per tahun\n","Lompatan 2018->2019           : 156.60%\n","Faktor penyambungan           : 2.2997\n","Wisatawan 2015: 6,413,735 -> setelah disambung 14,749,959\n","Pertumbuhan seri sambungan 2015-2025: 10.68% per tahun\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["3. Statistik Barlas (1989)"],"metadata":{"id":"liFOIz_p6m7_"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["def statistik_barlas(sim, obs):\n","    \"\"\"sim, obs: pandas Series dengan indeks tahun yang sama.\n","    Urutan mengikuti Barlas (1989): (1) perbandingan tren, (3) E1, (4) E2, (6) DC.\"\"\"\n","    from scipy import stats as st\n","    idx = obs.dropna().index.intersection(sim.dropna().index)\n","    t_ = np.asarray(idx, dtype=float)\n","    S = sim.loc[idx].to_numpy(dtype=float)\n","    A = obs.loc[idx].to_numpy(dtype=float)\n","    n = len(idx)\n","    Sbar, Abar = S.mean(), A.mean()\n","    Sstd, Astd = S.std(ddof=0), A.std(ddof=0)\n","\n","    # Langkah 1 — perbandingan tren linear (Y = b0 + b1 t)\n","    def kemiringan(y):\n","        b1, b0 = np.polyfit(t_, y, 1)\n","        resid = y - (b0 + b1 * t_)\n","        s2 = (resid ** 2).sum() / (n - 2) if n > 2 else np.nan   # STEYX^2\n","        var_b1 = s2 / ((t_ - t_.mean()) ** 2).sum()               # / DEVSQ(t)\n","        return b1, var_b1\n","    bA, vA = kemiringan(A)\n","    bS, vS = kemiringan(S)\n","    t_hit = abs(bS - bA) / np.sqrt(vA + vS) if (vA + vS) > 0 else np.nan\n","    t_tab = st.t.ppf(0.975, 2 * n - 4) if n > 2 else np.nan\n","    arah = \"Sama\" if np.sign(bA) == np.sign(bS) else \"Berlawanan\"\n","    if arah == \"Berlawanan\":\n","        status_tren = \"Berlawanan arah\"\n","    else:\n","        status_tren = \"Tidak berbeda nyata\" if t_hit <= t_tab else \"Berbeda nyata\"\n","\n","    # Langkah 3 dan 4 — E1 dan E2\n","    E1 = abs(Sbar - Abar) / abs(Abar)\n","    E2 = abs(Sstd - Astd) / Astd if Astd > 0 else np.nan\n","\n","    # Proporsi ketidaksamaan\n","    r = np.corrcoef(S, A)[0, 1] if Sstd > 0 and Astd > 0 else np.nan\n","    satu, dua = (Sbar - Abar) ** 2, (Sstd - Astd) ** 2\n","    tiga = 2 * (1 - r) * Sstd * Astd\n","    tot = satu + dua + tiga\n","    U1, U2, U3 = (satu / tot, dua / tot, tiga / tot) if tot > 0 else (np.nan,) * 3\n","\n","    # Langkah 6 — Discrepancy Coefficient\n","    galat = S - A\n","    DC = galat.std(ddof=0) / (Astd + Sstd) if (Astd + Sstd) > 0 else np.nan\n","    kategori_DC = \"Baik\" if DC < 0.4 else (\"Cukup\" if DC <= 0.7 else \"Kurang\")\n","\n","    MAPE = np.mean(np.abs(galat / A)) if (A != 0).all() else np.nan\n","    return dict(n=n,\n","                kemiringan_data=bA, kemiringan_simulasi=bS, t_hitung=t_hit, t_tabel=t_tab,\n","                arah_tren=arah, status_tren=status_tren,\n","                E1=E1, E2=E2, DC=DC, U1=U1, U2=U2, U3=U3, MAPE=MAPE,\n","                lolos_E1=\"Lolos\" if E1 <= 0.05 else \"Tidak\",\n","                lolos_E2=\"Lolos\" if E2 <= 0.30 else \"Tidak\",\n","                kategori_DC=kategori_DC)\n","\n","\n","def tabel_statistik(hasil_sim, data, label, tanpa_covid=False):\n","    baris = []\n","    for var, obs in data.items():\n","        if var not in hasil_sim:\n","            continue\n","        sim = hasil_sim[var]\n","        idx = [t for t in obs.dropna().index if t in sim.index]\n","        if tanpa_covid:\n","            idx = [t for t in idx if t not in TAHUN_COVID]\n","        if len(idx) < 3:\n","            continue\n","        st = statistik_barlas(sim.loc[idx], obs.loc[idx])\n","        baris.append({\"Uji\": label, \"Variabel\": var.strip('\"'),\n","                      \"Periode\": f\"{min(idx)}–{max(idx)}\",\n","                      \"Tahun COVID\": \"dikeluarkan\" if tanpa_covid else \"termasuk\", **st})\n","    return pd.DataFrame(baris)"],"metadata":{"id":"K_OiHM0u6pKH","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1789990433289,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":15,"user":{"displayName":"Kevin Atha Fathoni Ramadha","userId":"09413341038730317114"}}},"execution_count":15,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":[" 4. Uji A: uji perilaku parsial (subsistem dengan masukan data aktual)"],"metadata":{"id":"AQ6US4_A6sb7"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["def nilai_awal(tahun):\n","    return {\n","        \"Jumlah Wisatawan\": DATA_UJI[\"Jumlah Wisatawan\"][tahun],\n","        \"Jumlah Hotel dan Akomodasi\": DATA[\"Jumlah Hotel dan Akomodasi\"][tahun],\n","        \"Jumlah Objek Daya Tarik Wisata\": DATA[\"Jumlah Objek Daya Tarik Wisata\"][tahun],\n","        \"Tenaga Kerja Pariwisata\": DATA[\"Tenaga Kerja Pariwisata\"][tahun],\n","        \"Lahan Terbangun\": DATA[\"Lahan Terbangun\"][tahun],\n","    }\n","\n","TPK = '\"Tingkat Penghunian Kamar (TPK)\"'\n","KELUARAN = [\"Jumlah Wisatawan\", \"Jumlah Hotel dan Akomodasi\", \"Jumlah Objek Daya Tarik Wisata\",\n","            \"Tenaga Kerja Pariwisata\", \"Lahan Terbangun\", TPK,\n","            \"PDRB Sektor Pariwisata\", \"Investasi Sektor Pariwisata\", \"Total Malam Menginap\"]\n","\n","def jalankan(params, tahun_awal, tahun_akhir=TAHUN_AKHIR):\n","    m = pysd.read_vensim(FILE_MODEL)\n","    # stok yang digantikan data aktual tidak lagi berupa stok, jadi dikeluarkan\n","    awal = {k: v for k, v in nilai_awal(tahun_awal).items() if k not in params}\n","    r = m.run(params=params,\n","              initial_condition=(tahun_awal, awal),\n","              final_time=tahun_akhir,\n","              return_timestamps=list(range(tahun_awal, tahun_akhir + 1)),\n","              return_columns=KELUARAN)\n","    return r.apply(lambda s: np.real(s.astype(complex)))\n","\n","UJI_PARSIAL = {\n","    # label: (masukan data aktual, variabel yang dinilai)\n","    \"P1 Subsistem Hotel\": ([\"Jumlah Wisatawan\", \"Investasi Sektor Pariwisata\"],\n","                           [\"Jumlah Hotel dan Akomodasi\", TPK, \"Total Malam Menginap\"]),\n","    \"P2 Subsistem ODTW\": ([\"Investasi Sektor Pariwisata\"],\n","                          [\"Jumlah Objek Daya Tarik Wisata\"]),\n","    \"P3 Subsistem Tenaga Kerja\": ([\"PDRB Sektor Pariwisata\"],\n","                                  [\"Tenaga Kerja Pariwisata\"]),\n","    \"P4 Subsistem Lahan\": ([\"Jumlah Wisatawan\", \"Investasi Sektor Pariwisata\"],\n","                           [\"Lahan Terbangun\"]),\n","    \"P5 Subsistem Wisatawan\": ([\"Jumlah Objek Daya Tarik Wisata\", \"Lahan Terbangun\"],\n","                               [\"Jumlah Wisatawan\"]),\n","}\n","\n","hasil_parsial, tabel = {}, []\n","for label, (masukan, dinilai) in UJI_PARSIAL.items():\n","    params = {v: DATA_UJI[v].loc[TAHUN_AWAL_PARSIAL:TAHUN_AKHIR] for v in masukan}\n","    r = jalankan(params, TAHUN_AWAL_PARSIAL)\n","    hasil_parsial[label] = r\n","    data_nilai = {v: DATA_UJI[v] for v in dinilai}\n","    for tanpa in (False, True):\n","        tabel.append(tabel_statistik(r, data_nilai, label, tanpa_covid=tanpa))\n","    print(f\"{label}: masukan {', '.join(m.strip(chr(34)) for m in masukan)} -> dinilai {', '.join(d.strip(chr(34)) for d in dinilai)}\")"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"dakg8-lk6zM_","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1789990444193,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":7923,"user":{"displayName":"Kevin Atha Fathoni Ramadha","userId":"09413341038730317114"}},"outputId":"5583a961-e7f1-4840-fc6d-e50e918ff78c"},"execution_count":16,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["P1 Subsistem Hotel: masukan Jumlah Wisatawan, Investasi Sektor Pariwisata -> dinilai Jumlah Hotel dan Akomodasi, Tingkat Penghunian Kamar (TPK), Total Malam Menginap\n","P2 Subsistem ODTW: masukan Investasi Sektor Pariwisata -> dinilai Jumlah Objek Daya Tarik Wisata\n","P3 Subsistem Tenaga Kerja: masukan PDRB Sektor Pariwisata -> dinilai Tenaga Kerja Pariwisata\n","P4 Subsistem Lahan: masukan Jumlah Wisatawan, Investasi Sektor Pariwisata -> dinilai Lahan Terbangun\n","P5 Subsistem Wisatawan: masukan Jumlah Objek Daya Tarik Wisata, Lahan Terbangun -> dinilai Jumlah Wisatawan\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["5. Uji B: uji perilaku penuh periode pascapatahan (2019–2025)"],"metadata":{"id":"Q5NTtoJA60lD"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["r_penuh = jalankan({}, TAHUN_AWAL_PENUH)\n","for tanpa in (False, True):\n","    tabel.append(tabel_statistik(r_penuh, DATA_UJI, \"B Uji penuh 2019–2025\", tanpa_covid=tanpa))\n","\n","hasil = pd.concat(tabel, ignore_index=True)\n","kolom_urut = [\"Uji\", \"Variabel\", \"Periode\", \"Tahun COVID\", \"n\",\n","              \"kemiringan_data\", \"kemiringan_simulasi\", \"t_hitung\", \"t_tabel\", \"arah_tren\", \"status_tren\",\n","              \"E1\", \"E2\", \"DC\", \"U1\", \"U2\", \"U3\", \"MAPE\", \"lolos_E1\", \"lolos_E2\", \"kategori_DC\"]\n","hasil = hasil[kolom_urut].round(4)\n","print(\"\\n=== RINGKASAN STATISTIK ===\")\n","print(hasil.to_string(index=False))"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"E6Iln3EP63RB","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1789990448312,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":577,"user":{"displayName":"Kevin Atha Fathoni Ramadha","userId":"09413341038730317114"}},"outputId":"d5239cce-7099-4fd6-d06a-6c534cd33106"},"execution_count":17,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["\n","=== RINGKASAN STATISTIK ===\n","                      Uji                       Variabel   Periode Tahun COVID  n  kemiringan_data  kemiringan_